OL,3,GNEWSAHospital emergency department to
OL,4,Aget major upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe emergency department at Basildon
OL,7,FHospital is to be given an upgrade with
OL,8,Fa #6m investment.
OL,10,FHalf of the money will be used to more
OL,11,Fthan double the size of the Essex
OL,12,Fhospital's rapid assessment, triage and
OL,13,Ftreatment area, with eight larger
OL,14,Fassessment bays replacing the three
OL,15,Fcurrent ones.
OL,17,FMid and South Essex NHS Foundation
OL,18,FTrust said it would help the department
OL,19,Fsee and treat patients quicker.
OL,21,FThe other #3m will fund the replacement
OL,22,Fof the department's 20-year-old roof.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
